  "execution_order": [
    "Preflight and authenticate every pinned file, the normal V10 input, actual direct replay executable/build lineage, 46 resolved runtime libraries, coefficient table, source, and target metadata hashes. Do not open target numeric sections yet.",
    "Read the V10 input and calculate all 45 dry columns independently. For layers 1\u201332 use the target driver left-associated expression mass*Avogadro/(MOL_WEIGHT_DRY*10000). For layers 33\u201345 use the authenticated frontend get_col_dry pressure/H2O path with packet gravity and molecular weights.",
    "Construct only the N2-absent ten-gas columns and reconstruct the 45x128 source-ordered major/minor tau and term ledger with the pinned LW table and source contracts. Do not consume pfrac opacity values.",
    "Atomically persist and fsync the complete dry-column ledger, discrete state, tau array and term ledger, then record its SHA/size before opening the captured target result numeric arrays.",
    "Cross-check pfrac only as a discrete coordinate/context check: first require exact matched-input versus normal-input PLAY/PLEV/TLAY coordinate equality. Compare applicable temperature/pressure/tropopause indices and interpolation fractions; do not compare or infer gas roster, dry columns, or tau from positive-N2 pfrac. A failed coordinate join is a context check failure, not an opacity residual.",
    "Open only the authenticated normal result and compare saved dry column and GAS_TAU_RAW to the persisted reconstruction. Report signed/absolute residual and ordered binary64 ULP arrays/statistics without a tolerance-based PASS verdict."
  ],
